{"id":357,"slug":"357-utility-type-parameters-t-va-constructorparameters-t-la-gi","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Generics","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Utility type `Parameters<T>` và `ConstructorParameters<T>` là gì?","question_en":"What are the utility types `Parameters<T>` and `ConstructorParameters<T>`?","answer_vi":"Hai utility type **trích ra danh sách tham số** dưới dạng tuple.\n\n```typescript\nfunction createUser(name: string, age: number, active?: boolean) { }\n\ntype Args = Parameters<typeof createUser>\n// [name: string, age: number, active?: boolean]\n\nclass Service { constructor(url: string, timeout: number) { } }\n\ntype CtorArgs = ConstructorParameters<typeof Service>\n// [url: string, timeout: number]\n```\n\nBên trong cả hai đều dùng `infer`:\n\n```typescript\ntype Parameters<T> = T extends (...args: infer P) => any ? P : never\ntype ConstructorParameters<T> = T extends abstract new (...args: infer P) => any ? P : never\n```\n\nCông dụng thực tế nhất — **bọc một hàm mà không phải khai lại signature**:\n\n```typescript\nfunction withRetry<F extends (...args: any[]) => Promise<any>>(fn: F) {\n  return async (...args: Parameters<F>): Promise<Awaited<ReturnType<F>>> => {\n    try { return await fn(...args) }\n    catch { return await fn(...args) }\n  }\n}\n\nasync function saveUser(name: string, age: number) { /* gọi API */ }\n\nconst safeSave = withRetry(saveUser)\n// safeSave: (name: string, age: number) => Promise<void> — giữ nguyên kiểu tham số của saveUser\n```\n\nLấy một tham số riêng lẻ bằng chỉ số:\n\n```typescript\ntype FirstArg = Parameters<typeof createUser>[0]   // string\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** với hàm **nạp chồng (overload)**, `Parameters<T>` chỉ lấy được **signature cuối cùng**, không phải union của tất cả — đây là hạn chế đã biết của TypeScript và là chi tiết phân biệt người đã dùng thật","answer_en":"Two utility types that **extract a parameter list** as a tuple.\n\n```typescript\nfunction createUser(name: string, age: number, active?: boolean) { }\n\ntype Args = Parameters<typeof createUser>\n// [name: string, age: number, active?: boolean]\n\nclass Service { constructor(url: string, timeout: number) { } }\n\ntype CtorArgs = ConstructorParameters<typeof Service>\n// [url: string, timeout: number]\n```\n\nBoth are built on `infer`:\n\n```typescript\ntype Parameters<T> = T extends (...args: infer P) => any ? P : never\ntype ConstructorParameters<T> = T extends abstract new (...args: infer P) => any ? P : never\n```\n\nThe most practical use — **wrapping a function without restating its signature**:\n\n```typescript\nfunction withRetry<F extends (...args: any[]) => Promise<any>>(fn: F) {\n  return async (...args: Parameters<F>): Promise<Awaited<ReturnType<F>>> => {\n    try { return await fn(...args) }\n    catch { return await fn(...args) }\n  }\n}\n\nasync function saveUser(name: string, age: number) { /* call the API */ }\n\nconst safeSave = withRetry(saveUser)\n// safeSave: (name: string, age: number) => Promise<void> — keeps saveUser's parameter types\n```\n\nPick a single parameter by index:\n\n```typescript\ntype FirstArg = Parameters<typeof createUser>[0]   // string\n```\n\n**Note:** for **overloaded** functions, `Parameters<T>` only picks up the **last signature**, not a union of all of them — a known TypeScript limitation and a detail that separates people who have actually used it","answer_html_vi":"<p>Hai utility type <strong>trích ra danh sách tham số</strong> dưới dạng tuple.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function createUser(name: string, age: number, active?: boolean) { }\n\ntype Args = Parameters&lt;typeof createUser&gt;\n// [name: string, age: number, active?: boolean]\n\nclass Service { constructor(url: string, timeout: number) { } }\n\ntype CtorArgs = ConstructorParameters&lt;typeof Service&gt;\n// [url: string, timeout: number]\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">active</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">boolean</span></span>) { }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Args</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> createUser&gt;\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [name: string, age: number, active?: boolean]</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Service</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">constructor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">url</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">timeout</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) { } }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CtorArgs</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConstructorParameters</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Service</span>&gt;\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [url: string, timeout: number]</span></code></pre></div><p>Bên trong cả hai đều dùng <code>infer</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Parameters&lt;T&gt; = T extends (...args: infer P) =&gt; any ? P : never\ntype ConstructorParameters&lt;T&gt; = T extends abstract new (...args: infer P) =&gt; any ? P : never\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;T&gt; = T <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">extends</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: infer P) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span> ? P : <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">never</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConstructorParameters</span>&lt;T&gt; = T <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">abstract</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">new</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: infer P) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span> ? P : <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">never</span></code></pre></div><p>Công dụng thực tế nhất — <strong>bọc một hàm mà không phải khai lại signature</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function withRetry&lt;F extends (...args: any[]) =&gt; Promise&lt;any&gt;&gt;(fn: F) {\n  return async (...args: Parameters&lt;F&gt;): Promise&lt;Awaited&lt;ReturnType&lt;F&gt;&gt;&gt; =&gt; {\n    try { return await fn(...args) }\n    catch { return await fn(...args) }\n  }\n}\n\nasync function saveUser(name: string, age: number) { /* gọi API */ }\n\nconst safeSave = withRetry(saveUser)\n// safeSave: (name: string, age: number) =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt; — giữ nguyên kiểu tham số của saveUser\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> withRetry&lt;F <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">extends</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>[]) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>&gt;&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">fn</span>: F) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;F&gt;): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Awaited</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReturnType</span>&lt;F&gt;&gt;&gt; =&gt; {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(...args) }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(...args) }\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">saveUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* gọi API */</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> safeSave = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">withRetry</span>(saveUser)\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// safeSave: (name: string, age: number) =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt; — giữ nguyên kiểu tham số của saveUser</span></code></pre></div><p>Lấy một tham số riêng lẻ bằng chỉ số:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type FirstArg = Parameters&lt;typeof createUser&gt;[0]   // string\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">FirstArg</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> createUser&gt;[<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>]   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// string</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> với hàm <strong>nạp chồng (overload)</strong>, <code>Parameters&lt;T&gt;</code> chỉ lấy được <strong>signature cuối cùng</strong>, không phải union của tất cả — đây là hạn chế đã biết của TypeScript và là chi tiết phân biệt người đã dùng thật.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Two utility types that <strong>extract a parameter list</strong> as a tuple.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function createUser(name: string, age: number, active?: boolean) { }\n\ntype Args = Parameters&lt;typeof createUser&gt;\n// [name: string, age: number, active?: boolean]\n\nclass Service { constructor(url: string, timeout: number) { } }\n\ntype CtorArgs = ConstructorParameters&lt;typeof Service&gt;\n// [url: string, timeout: number]\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">createUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">active</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">boolean</span></span>) { }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Args</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> createUser&gt;\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [name: string, age: number, active?: boolean]</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Service</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">constructor</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">url</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">timeout</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) { } }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">CtorArgs</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConstructorParameters</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Service</span>&gt;\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// [url: string, timeout: number]</span></code></pre></div><p>Both are built on <code>infer</code>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type Parameters&lt;T&gt; = T extends (...args: infer P) =&gt; any ? P : never\ntype ConstructorParameters&lt;T&gt; = T extends abstract new (...args: infer P) =&gt; any ? P : never\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;T&gt; = T <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">extends</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: infer P) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span> ? P : <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">never</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ConstructorParameters</span>&lt;T&gt; = T <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">abstract</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">new</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: infer P) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span> ? P : <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">never</span></code></pre></div><p>The most practical use — <strong>wrapping a function without restating its signature</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function withRetry&lt;F extends (...args: any[]) =&gt; Promise&lt;any&gt;&gt;(fn: F) {\n  return async (...args: Parameters&lt;F&gt;): Promise&lt;Awaited&lt;ReturnType&lt;F&gt;&gt;&gt; =&gt; {\n    try { return await fn(...args) }\n    catch { return await fn(...args) }\n  }\n}\n\nasync function saveUser(name: string, age: number) { /* call the API */ }\n\nconst safeSave = withRetry(saveUser)\n// safeSave: (name: string, age: number) =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt; — keeps saveUser's parameter types\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> withRetry&lt;F <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">extends</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>[]) =&gt; <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>&gt;&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">fn</span>: F) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (...<span class=\"hljs-attr\">args</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;F&gt;): <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Promise</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Awaited</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReturnType</span>&lt;F&gt;&gt;&gt; =&gt; {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">try</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(...args) }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">catch</span> { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">fn</span>(...args) }\n  }\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">saveUser</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">age</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>) { <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* call the API */</span> }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> safeSave = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">withRetry</span>(saveUser)\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// safeSave: (name: string, age: number) =&gt; Promise&lt;void&gt; — keeps saveUser&#x27;s parameter types</span></code></pre></div><p>Pick a single parameter by index:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"type FirstArg = Parameters&lt;typeof createUser&gt;[0]   // string\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">FirstArg</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Parameters</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">typeof</span> createUser&gt;[<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>]   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// string</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Note:</strong> for <strong>overloaded</strong> functions, <code>Parameters&lt;T&gt;</code> only picks up the <strong>last signature</strong>, not a union of all of them — a known TypeScript limitation and a detail that separates people who have actually used it.</p>","references":[{"label":"TypeScript — Parameters<Type>","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/utility-types.html#parameterstype"},{"label":"TypeScript — ConstructorParameters<Type>","url":"https://www.typescriptlang.org/docs/handbook/utility-types.html#constructorparameterstype"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/346-generics-trong-typescript-la-gi-tai-sao-can-thiet","title":"Generics trong TypeScript là gì? Tại sao cần thiết?"},{"url":"/q/347-generic-constraints-extends-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Generic constraints (extends) trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/321-typescript-la-gi-va-tai-sao-nen-dung-typescript-thay-javascript","title":"TypeScript là gì và tại sao nên dùng TypeScript thay JavaScript?"},{"url":"/q/322-type-annotation-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Type annotation trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/323-any-unknown-va-never-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"any, unknown và never khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/324-union-types-va-intersection-types-la-gi","title":"Union types và intersection types là gì?"},{"url":"/q/325-literal-types-trong-typescript-la-gi","title":"Literal types trong TypeScript là gì?"},{"url":"/q/327-type-narrowing-la-gi-cac-cach-narrow-type-